.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE PROJECT DISABLE"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute project disable \- Opt out of one Attribute for the selected Project; existing assignments remain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute project disable [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opt out of one Attribute for the selected Project; existing assignments remain
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Stable Attribute key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --reason
Optional audit reason
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
